bm25.textExcerpt:
Document: mutual-provisions-pkv.pdf
Section: 76 Supplemental cover for
cantonal building or house - hold contents insurance Cover is not provided for reductions and rejections of benefits due to:
a) breach of obligations, such as failure to comply with requirements and preventive measures;
b) gross negligence;
c) underinsurance;
d) inactive insurance status as a result of failure to pay premiums. Similarly, no benefits are paid for:
e) deductibles;
f) purely cosmetic damage, where the function of the object is not impaired;
g) buildings and parts of buildings that are excluded from cantonal bu

